       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet. The dose looks like it might be a mistake, so I'd like you to confirm it first.\n\n**The problem:** 1600 mg four times daily comes to **6400 mg/day** of ibuprofen.\n- The usual maximum single oral dose for adults is **800 mg**. This order is twice that per dose.\n- The usual maximum daily dose for adults is **3200 mg/day**. This order is twice that per day.\n- At this dose, the risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury and other NSAID side effects goes up a lot, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\n**Did you mean one of these?**\n- Ibuprofen **400 mg** PO QID (1600 mg/day)\n- Ibuprofen **600 mg** PO QID (2400 mg/day)\n- Ibuprofen **800 mg** PO TID (2400 mg/day) or **800 mg** PO QID (3200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **1600 mg/day** as the total daily dose, split up (for example, 400 mg QID)\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it right away. If you do mean 1600 mg QID on purpose, please confirm and give me the reason, and I'll add it to the order note."
      }
